{"id":"u3","lessons":[{"id":"u3-l1","title":"特殊锐角的值","subtitle":"$30^\\circ,45^\\circ,60^\\circ$","intro":[{"title":"为什么单独记 $30^\\circ,45^\\circ,60^\\circ$","body":"这三个角在考试和后续推导里出现得最频繁，它们的三角值又都是**能用初中几何精确算出**的漂亮数（带根号的分数）。\n\n更要紧的是：它们不是天降的，而是从两个简单三角形里量出来的。下面把它们**推一遍**——记不住时随时能重建。"},{"title":"$45^\\circ$：来自等腰直角三角形","body":"两条直角边相等的直角三角形，两个锐角都是 $45^\\circ$。取两条直角边都为 $1$：","steps":["斜边 $=\\sqrt{1^2+1^2}=\\sqrt2$（勾股定理）","$\\sin45^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\text{对}}{\\text{斜}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","$\\cos45^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\text{邻}}{\\text{斜}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$"],"tip":"$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}$ 与 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$ 是同一个数（分母有理化）：$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{1\\times\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt2\\times\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$。课本一般写后者。"},{"title":"$30^\\circ$ 与 $60^\\circ$：等边三角形劈一半","body":"把边长为 $2$ 的等边三角形从顶点垂直劈成两半，得到一个 $30^\\circ$-$60^\\circ$-$90^\\circ$ 直角三角形：","steps":["斜边（原边）$=2$，短直角边（底的一半）$=1$，长直角边 $=\\sqrt{2^2-1^2}=\\sqrt3$","对 $30^\\circ$：对边是短边 $1$，$\\sin30^\\circ=\\dfrac12$，$\\cos30^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","对 $60^\\circ$：对边是长边 $\\sqrt3$，$\\sin60^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$，$\\cos60^\\circ=\\dfrac12$"],"tip":"$30^\\circ$ 和 $60^\\circ$ 的 $\\sin,\\cos$ 正好**互换**——因为在同一个三角形里它俩互为余角，一个的对边正是另一个的邻边。"},{"title":"汇总成一张表","body":"把刚推出的三个特殊角的 $\\sin,\\cos$ 列在一起：","formula":"\\begin{array}{c|ccc}\\theta&30^\\circ&45^\\circ&60^\\circ\\\\\\hline \\sin&\\tfrac12&\\tfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}&\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\\\[2pt] \\cos&\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}&\\tfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}&\\tfrac12\\end{array}"},{"title":"一个让你秒记的窍门","body":"把 $\\sin30^\\circ,\\sin45^\\circ,\\sin60^\\circ$ 统一写成 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\ \\cdot\\ }}{2}$ 的样子，根号里就是 **$1,2,3$ 递增**（$\\sqrt1=1$ 所以是 $\\dfrac12$）：","formula":"\\sin:\\ \\dfrac{\\sqrt1}{2},\\ \\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2},\\ \\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\qquad \\cos:\\ \\text{把这串倒过来}","tip":"角从小到大，$\\sin$ 变大、$\\cos$ 变小——符合直觉：角越大，对边越长（$\\sin\\uparrow$）、邻边越短（$\\cos\\downarrow$）。"},{"title":"$\\tan$ 不用背，现推","body":"有了 $\\sin,\\cos$，$\\tan=\\dfrac{\\sin}{\\cos}$ 当场两步出：","steps":["$\\tan30^\\circ=\\dfrac{1/2}{\\sqrt3/2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt3}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}$","$\\tan45^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2/2}{\\sqrt2/2}=1$","$\\tan60^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3/2}{1/2}=\\sqrt3$"],"reveal":{"q":"不查表，$\\cos30^\\circ\\times\\tan30^\\circ=?$","a":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\times\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}=\\dfrac{3}{6}=\\dfrac12$，正好是 $\\sin30^\\circ$（因为 $\\cos\\cdot\\tan=\\cos\\cdot\\dfrac{\\sin}{\\cos}=\\sin$）。"}}],"questions":[{"id":"u3-l1-q1","type":"input","prompt":"$\\sin 30^\\circ=?$（填分数或小数）","accept":["1/2","0.5"],"explain":"$\\sin 30^\\circ=\\dfrac12$。"},{"id":"u3-l1-q2","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\cos 30^\\circ=?$","options":["$\\dfrac12$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","$1$"],"answer":2,"explain":"$\\cos 30^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$。"},{"id":"u3-l1-q3","type":"input","prompt":"$\\tan 45^\\circ=?$","accept":["1"],"explain":"$\\tan 45^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sin45^\\circ}{\\cos45^\\circ}=1$。"},{"id":"u3-l1-q4","type":"input","prompt":"$\\sin 60^\\circ=?$（可写 √3/2 或 sqrt3/2）","accept":["√3/2","sqrt3/2","(√3)/2","0.866","\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}"],"explain":"$\\sin 60^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\approx0.866$。"},{"id":"u3-l1-q5","type":"match","prompt":"把角与它的正弦值配对。","left":["$\\sin 30^\\circ$","$\\sin 45^\\circ$","$\\sin 60^\\circ$"],"right":["$\\dfrac12$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$"],"explain":"$\\sin$ 在 $30/45/60$ 依次为 $\\tfrac12,\\tfrac{\\sqrt2}{2},\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$（递增）。"},{"id":"u3-l1-q6","type":"judge","prompt":"$\\tan 60^\\circ=\\sqrt3$。","answer":true,"explain":"$\\tan 60^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sin60^\\circ}{\\cos60^\\circ}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3/2}{1/2}=\\sqrt3$。"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"$\\cos 45^\\circ = ?$","options":["$\\dfrac12$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","$1$"],"answer":2,"explain":"$\\cos 45^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$（等腰直角三角形中邻边与斜边之比）。","id":"u3-l1-q7"},{"type":"input","prompt":"$\\cos 60^\\circ = ?$（填分数）","accept":["1/2","0.5"],"explain":"$\\cos 60^\\circ = \\dfrac12$（$30$-$60$-$90$ 三角形中 $60^\\circ$ 的邻边为短边 $1$，斜边为 $2$）。","id":"u3-l1-q8"},{"type":"judge","prompt":"$\\sin 30^\\circ > \\sin 45^\\circ$。","answer":false,"explain":"$\\sin 30^\\circ = \\dfrac12 \\approx 0.5 < \\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2} \\approx 0.707 = \\sin 45^\\circ$，故该说法错误。","id":"u3-l1-q9"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"$\\tan 30^\\circ = ?$","options":["$\\sqrt3$","$1$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}$","$\\dfrac12$"],"answer":2,"explain":"$\\tan 30^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sin 30^\\circ}{\\cos 30^\\circ} = \\dfrac{1/2}{\\sqrt3/2} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt3} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}$。","id":"u3-l1-q10"},{"type":"input","prompt":"$\\tan 60^\\circ = ?$（可写 sqrt3）","accept":["√3","sqrt3","\\sqrt3","1.732"],"explain":"$\\tan 60^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sqrt3/2}{1/2} = \\sqrt3$。","id":"u3-l1-q11"},{"type":"match","prompt":"把每个角与其余弦值配对。","left":["$\\cos 30^\\circ$","$\\cos 45^\\circ$","$\\cos 60^\\circ$"],"right":["$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","$\\dfrac12$"],"explain":"$\\cos$ 在 $30/45/60$ 依次为 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$、$\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$、$\\dfrac12$（递减）。","id":"u3-l1-q12"},{"type":"judge","prompt":"$\\sin 60^\\circ = \\cos 30^\\circ$。","answer":true,"explain":"$\\sin 60^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$，$\\cos 30^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$，两者相等。这是因为 $30^\\circ$ 与 $60^\\circ$ 互为余角，余角的正弦等于另一角的余弦。","id":"u3-l1-q13"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"在 $30°$-$60°$-$90°$ 直角三角形中，斜边长为 $4$，则短直角边长为？","options":["$1$","$2$","$2\\sqrt3$","$4\\sqrt3$"],"answer":1,"explain":"短直角边对应 $30^\\circ$，其长 $= $ 斜边 $\\times \\sin 30^\\circ = 4 \\times \\dfrac12 = 2$。","id":"u3-l1-q14"},{"type":"input","prompt":"计算 $\\sin 30^\\circ + \\cos 60^\\circ$（填最简分数或整数）","accept":["1","1/1"],"explain":"$\\sin 30^\\circ + \\cos 60^\\circ = \\dfrac12 + \\dfrac12 = 1$。","id":"u3-l1-q15"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"下列哪个等式**不**成立？","options":["$\\sin 45^\\circ = \\cos 45^\\circ$","$\\tan 45^\\circ = 1$","$\\sin 30^\\circ = \\cos 60^\\circ$","$\\tan 30^\\circ = \\tan 60^\\circ$"],"answer":3,"explain":"$\\tan 30^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{3} \\ne \\sqrt3 = \\tan 60^\\circ$，其余三项均成立。","id":"u3-l1-q16"}]},{"id":"u3-l2","title":"象限轴上的值","subtitle":"$0^\\circ,90^\\circ,180^\\circ,270^\\circ$","intro":[{"title":"终边落在坐标轴上的四个角","body":"$0^\\circ,90^\\circ,180^\\circ,270^\\circ$ 的终边正好压在坐标轴上，与单位圆交于四个“整点”：","steps":["$0^\\circ\\to(1,0)$（正右）","$90^\\circ\\to(0,1)$（正上）","$180^\\circ\\to(-1,0)$（正左）","$270^\\circ\\to(0,-1)$（正下）"],"image":"trig-p1-01-1.svg","imageCaption":"单位圆上四个轴向位置的坐标"},{"title":"直接读坐标即得 $\\sin,\\cos$","body":"横坐标是 $\\cos$、纵坐标是 $\\sin$，逐个读出来：","steps":["$0^\\circ$：$(1,0)$ → $\\cos0^\\circ=1,\\ \\sin0^\\circ=0$","$90^\\circ$：$(0,1)$ → $\\cos90^\\circ=0,\\ \\sin90^\\circ=1$","$180^\\circ$：$(-1,0)$ → $\\cos180^\\circ=-1,\\ \\sin180^\\circ=0$","$270^\\circ$：$(0,-1)$ → $\\cos270^\\circ=0,\\ \\sin270^\\circ=-1$"],"tip":"这些值不用背：脑里摆一下终边指向（右/上/左/下），读坐标即可。"},{"title":"$\\tan$ 在轴上：要么是 $0$，要么没定义","body":"$\\tan\\theta=\\dfrac{\\sin}{\\cos}=\\dfrac{y}{x}$，在轴上会走两个极端：","steps":["终边在 $x$ 轴（$0^\\circ,180^\\circ$）：$y=0$，$\\tan=\\dfrac{0}{\\pm1}=0$","终边在 $y$ 轴（$90^\\circ,270^\\circ$）：$x=0$，$\\tan=\\dfrac{\\pm1}{0}$ **无定义**（不能除以 $0$）"],"tip":"“$\\tan90^\\circ$ 无定义”不是因为它“很大”，而是因为分母 $\\cos90^\\circ=0$ 根本不允许作除数。几何上对应终边竖直、斜率量不出来。"},{"title":"小结一圈的变化","body":"绕一圈看这四个角：$\\sin:0\\to1\\to0\\to-1$；$\\cos:1\\to0\\to-1\\to0$。两串值正好“错开一个角”——这正是后面学图象时“$\\cos$ 是 $\\sin$ 平移 $90^\\circ$”的根。","reveal":{"q":"$\\sin180^\\circ+\\cos180^\\circ=?$","a":"$\\sin180^\\circ=0$，$\\cos180^\\circ=-1$，和为 $-1$。"}}],"questions":[{"id":"u3-l2-q1","type":"input","prompt":"$\\cos 0^\\circ=?$","accept":["1"],"explain":"$\\cos 0^\\circ=1$。"},{"id":"u3-l2-q2","type":"input","prompt":"$\\sin 90^\\circ=?$","accept":["1"],"explain":"$\\sin 90^\\circ=1$（单位圆最高点）。"},{"id":"u3-l2-q3","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\cos 90^\\circ=?$","options":["$1$","$0$","$-1$","不存在"],"answer":1,"explain":"$\\cos 90^\\circ=0$，点为 $(0,1)$。"},{"id":"u3-l2-q4","type":"judge","prompt":"$\\tan 90^\\circ$ 不存在（无定义）。","answer":true,"explain":"$\\cos 90^\\circ=0$ 作分母，故 $\\tan 90^\\circ$ 无定义。"},{"id":"u3-l2-q5","type":"input","prompt":"$\\sin 180^\\circ=?$","accept":["0"],"explain":"$\\sin 180^\\circ=0$，点为 $(-1,0)$。"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"$\\sin 0^\\circ = ?$","options":["$1$","$0$","$-1$","不存在"],"answer":1,"explain":"$0^\\circ$ 的终边在正 $x$ 轴，单位圆交点为 $(1,0)$，纵坐标 $y = 0$，故 $\\sin 0^\\circ = 0$。","id":"u3-l2-q6"},{"type":"input","prompt":"$\\cos 180^\\circ = ?$（填整数）","accept":["-1"],"explain":"$180^\\circ$ 终边在负 $x$ 轴，交点 $(-1,0)$，横坐标为 $-1$，故 $\\cos 180^\\circ = -1$。","id":"u3-l2-q7"},{"type":"judge","prompt":"$\\cos 270^\\circ = 0$。","answer":true,"explain":"$270^\\circ$ 终边在负 $y$ 轴，交点 $(0,-1)$，横坐标为 $0$，故 $\\cos 270^\\circ = 0$。","id":"u3-l2-q8"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"$\\sin 270^\\circ = ?$","options":["$0$","$1$","$-1$","不存在"],"answer":2,"explain":"$270^\\circ$ 终边在负 $y$ 轴，交点 $(0,-1)$，纵坐标为 $-1$，故 $\\sin 270^\\circ = -1$。","id":"u3-l2-q9"},{"type":"match","prompt":"把轴角与其终边位置配对。","left":["$0^\\circ$","$90^\\circ$","$180^\\circ$","$270^\\circ$"],"right":["正 $x$ 轴（正右）","正 $y$ 轴（正上）","负 $x$ 轴（正左）","负 $y$ 轴（正下）"],"explain":"终边依次压在四条坐标轴的正半轴和负半轴上。","id":"u3-l2-q10"},{"type":"judge","prompt":"$\\tan 180^\\circ = 0$。","answer":true,"explain":"$\\tan 180^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sin 180^\\circ}{\\cos 180^\\circ} = \\dfrac{0}{-1} = 0$。","id":"u3-l2-q11"},{"type":"input","prompt":"计算 $\\sin 0^\\circ + \\cos 90^\\circ + \\sin 180^\\circ$（填整数）","accept":["0"],"explain":"$\\sin 0^\\circ = 0$，$\\cos 90^\\circ = 0$，$\\sin 180^\\circ = 0$，三者之和为 $0$。","id":"u3-l2-q12"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"以下哪个角的 $\\tan$ 值**存在**？","options":["$90^\\circ$","$270^\\circ$","$180^\\circ$","以上均不存在"],"answer":2,"explain":"$\\tan 180^\\circ = 0$（存在）；$\\tan 90^\\circ$ 和 $\\tan 270^\\circ$ 因 $\\cos = 0$ 而无定义。","id":"u3-l2-q13"},{"type":"judge","prompt":"$\\sin 90^\\circ + \\sin 270^\\circ = 0$。","answer":true,"explain":"$\\sin 90^\\circ = 1$，$\\sin 270^\\circ = -1$，两者之和为 $0$。","id":"u3-l2-q14"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"绕单位圆一圈，$\\sin$ 经历的值依次是？","options":["$0 \\to 1 \\to 0 \\to -1$","$1 \\to 0 \\to -1 \\to 0$","$0 \\to -1 \\to 0 \\to 1$","$1 \\to 1 \\to -1 \\to -1$"],"answer":0,"explain":"从 $0^\\circ$ 出发，$\\sin$ 依次为 $0$（$0^\\circ$）、$1$（$90^\\circ$）、$0$（$180^\\circ$）、$-1$（$270^\\circ$）。","id":"u3-l2-q15"}]},{"id":"u3-l3","title":"参考角与诱导","subtitle":"把任意角“搬回”锐角","intro":[{"title":"诱导公式：把任意角的值搬回锐角来算","body":"我们只对 $0^\\circ$~$90^\\circ$ 的锐角（尤其 $30,45,60^\\circ$）的三角值最熟。诱导公式做的，就是利用单位圆的**对称性**，把一个大角（钝角、负角、超 $360^\\circ$）的三角值，化到一个熟悉的锐角上去算。","image":"trig-p1-03-1.svg","imageCaption":"关于 $x$ 轴 / $y$ 轴 / 原点的对称，决定符号怎么变"},{"title":"补角公式：从“关于 $y$ 轴对称”推","body":"看 $\\theta$ 与 $180^\\circ-\\theta$ 这一对（比如 $30^\\circ$ 与 $150^\\circ$）。它们的终边关于 **$y$ 轴对称**，交点坐标“横相反、纵相同”：","steps":["设 $\\theta$ 的交点 $P=(x,y)$，则 $180^\\circ-\\theta$ 的交点是 $P^\\prime=(-x,\\ y)$","纵坐标相同 → $\\sin(180^\\circ-\\theta)=y=\\sin\\theta$","横坐标相反 → $\\cos(180^\\circ-\\theta)=-x=-\\cos\\theta$"],"formula":"\\sin(180^\\circ-\\theta)=\\sin\\theta,\\qquad \\cos(180^\\circ-\\theta)=-\\cos\\theta","tip":"不用背，记“补角终边关于 $y$ 轴翻一下”：纵坐标（$\\sin$）不变，横坐标（$\\cos$）变号。"},{"title":"负角公式：从“关于 $x$ 轴对称”推","body":"$-\\theta$ 的终边，是把 $\\theta$ 的终边沿 $x$ 轴翻下去：横坐标不变、纵坐标变号，$P=(x,y)\\to(x,-y)$：","steps":["$\\cos(-\\theta)=x=\\cos\\theta$ ——$\\cos$ 是**偶函数**","$\\sin(-\\theta)=-y=-\\sin\\theta$ ——$\\sin$ 是**奇函数**"],"formula":"\\cos(-\\theta)=\\cos\\theta,\\qquad \\sin(-\\theta)=-\\sin\\theta","tip":"一句话：$\\cos$ 偶（去掉负号）、$\\sin$ 奇（负号提到外面）。例如 $\\cos(-30^\\circ)=\\cos30^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$。"},{"title":"例题精讲：两题","body":"**①** 求 $\\sin150^\\circ$。","steps":["$150^\\circ=180^\\circ-30^\\circ$，用补角：$\\sin150^\\circ=\\sin30^\\circ=\\dfrac12$","**②** 求 $\\cos120^\\circ$。","$120^\\circ=180^\\circ-60^\\circ$，用补角：$\\cos120^\\circ=-\\cos60^\\circ=-\\dfrac12$"],"tip":"第②题的负号来自“补角让 $\\cos$ 变号”。这和上一单元直接读坐标 $P=\\left(-\\dfrac12,\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\right)$ 得 $\\cos120^\\circ=-\\dfrac12$ 完全一致——两条路殊途同归。"},{"title":"总口诀：奇变偶不变，符号看象限","body":"处理形如 “$90^\\circ\\times k\\pm\\theta$” 的角时，分两步：\n\n**“奇变偶不变”**——看 $90^\\circ$ 的**倍数 $k$**：$k$ 为奇数则函数名要变（$\\sin\\leftrightarrow\\cos$），$k$ 为偶数则名字不变。\n\n**“符号看象限”**——把原角当锐角，看整个角落在第几象限，按那象限里**原函数**的正负定号。","tip":"最常见的错：只换了名字却忘了定符号，或反过来。先定名（奇偶）、再定号（象限），两步缺一不可。"},{"title":"试一试","body":"用补角或商数关系化简：","reveal":{"q":"$\\tan(180^\\circ-\\theta)=?$（用 $\\sin,\\cos$ 推）","a":"$\\dfrac{\\sin(180^\\circ-\\theta)}{\\cos(180^\\circ-\\theta)}=\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{-\\cos\\theta}=-\\tan\\theta$。"}}],"questions":[{"id":"u3-l3-q1","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\sin(180^\\circ-\\theta)$ 等于？","options":["$-\\sin\\theta$","$\\sin\\theta$","$\\cos\\theta$","$-\\cos\\theta$"],"answer":1,"explain":"$\\sin(180^\\circ-\\theta)=\\sin\\theta$（补角正弦相等）。"},{"id":"u3-l3-q2","type":"input","prompt":"利用诱导公式求 $\\sin 150^\\circ$。","accept":["1/2","0.5"],"explain":"$\\sin 150^\\circ=\\sin(180^\\circ-30^\\circ)=\\sin 30^\\circ=\\dfrac12$。"},{"id":"u3-l3-q3","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\cos(-\\theta)$ 等于？","options":["$-\\cos\\theta$","$\\cos\\theta$","$\\sin\\theta$","$-\\sin\\theta$"],"answer":1,"explain":"余弦是偶函数：$\\cos(-\\theta)=\\cos\\theta$。"},{"id":"u3-l3-q4","type":"judge","prompt":"$\\sin(-\\theta)=-\\sin\\theta$（正弦是奇函数）。","answer":true,"explain":"正弦关于原点对称，为奇函数。"},{"id":"u3-l3-q5","type":"input","prompt":"求 $\\cos 120^\\circ$（填分数）。","accept":["-1/2","-0.5"],"explain":"$\\cos 120^\\circ=\\cos(180^\\circ-60^\\circ)=-\\cos 60^\\circ=-\\dfrac12$。"},{"id":"u3-l3-q6","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\tan 225^\\circ=?$","options":["$-1$","$1$","$\\sqrt3$","$0$"],"answer":1,"explain":"$225^\\circ=180^\\circ+45^\\circ$，第三象限 $\\tan>0$，$\\tan225^\\circ=\\tan45^\\circ=1$。"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"$\\cos(180^\\circ - \\theta)$ 等于？","options":["$\\cos\\theta$","$-\\cos\\theta$","$\\sin\\theta$","$-\\sin\\theta$"],"answer":1,"explain":"补角公式：终边关于 $y$ 轴对称，横坐标变号，故 $\\cos(180^\\circ - \\theta) = -\\cos\\theta$。","id":"u3-l3-q7"},{"type":"input","prompt":"利用诱导公式求 $\\cos 120^\\circ$（填最简分数）","accept":["-1/2","-0.5"],"explain":"$\\cos 120^\\circ = \\cos(180^\\circ - 60^\\circ) = -\\cos 60^\\circ = -\\dfrac12$。","id":"u3-l3-q8"},{"type":"judge","prompt":"$\\cos(-60^\\circ) = \\cos 60^\\circ$。","answer":true,"explain":"余弦是偶函数：$\\cos(-\\theta) = \\cos\\theta$，故 $\\cos(-60^\\circ) = \\cos 60^\\circ = \\dfrac12$。","id":"u3-l3-q9"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"$\\sin(-45^\\circ) = ?$","options":["$\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","$-\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$","$\\dfrac12$","$-\\dfrac12$"],"answer":1,"explain":"正弦是奇函数：$\\sin(-45^\\circ) = -\\sin 45^\\circ = -\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$。","id":"u3-l3-q10"},{"type":"input","prompt":"利用诱导公式求 $\\sin 135^\\circ$（可写 sqrt2/2）","accept":["√2/2","sqrt2/2","\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}","(√2)/2","0.707"],"explain":"$\\sin 135^\\circ = \\sin(180^\\circ - 45^\\circ) = \\sin 45^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$。","id":"u3-l3-q11"},{"type":"match","prompt":"把角与用诱导公式化简后的等价结果配对。","left":["$\\sin 150^\\circ$","$\\cos 150^\\circ$","$\\sin(-30^\\circ)$"],"right":["$\\sin 30^\\circ$","$-\\cos 30^\\circ$","$-\\sin 30^\\circ$"],"explain":"$\\sin 150^\\circ = \\sin 30^\\circ$；$\\cos 150^\\circ = -\\cos 30^\\circ$；$\\sin(-30^\\circ) = -\\sin 30^\\circ$。","id":"u3-l3-q12"},{"type":"judge","prompt":"$\\tan(180^\\circ - \\theta) = \\tan\\theta$。","answer":false,"explain":"$\\tan(180^\\circ - \\theta) = \\dfrac{\\sin(180^\\circ-\\theta)}{\\cos(180^\\circ-\\theta)} = \\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{-\\cos\\theta} = -\\tan\\theta$，带负号，故原式错误。","id":"u3-l3-q13"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"$\\sin 210^\\circ = ?$","options":["$\\dfrac12$","$-\\dfrac12$","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","$-\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$"],"answer":1,"explain":"$210^\\circ = 180^\\circ + 30^\\circ$，第三象限正弦为负；参考角 $30^\\circ$ 的正弦为 $\\dfrac12$，故 $\\sin 210^\\circ = -\\dfrac12$。","id":"u3-l3-q14"},{"type":"input","prompt":"计算 $\\cos(-30^\\circ) + \\sin 150^\\circ$（填最简分数或根号形式）","accept":["√3/2+1/2","sqrt3/2+1/2","\\frac{\\sqrt3+1}{2}","(√3+1)/2"],"explain":"$\\cos(-30^\\circ) = \\cos 30^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$，$\\sin 150^\\circ = \\sin 30^\\circ = \\dfrac12$，两者之和为 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt3+1}{2}$。","id":"u3-l3-q15"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"以下说法正确的是？","options":["$\\cos$ 是奇函数","$\\sin$ 是偶函数","$\\sin(-\\theta) = \\sin\\theta$","$\\cos(-\\theta) = \\cos\\theta$"],"answer":3,"explain":"$\\cos$ 是偶函数：$\\cos(-\\theta) = \\cos\\theta$；$\\sin$ 是奇函数：$\\sin(-\\theta) = -\\sin\\theta$。","id":"u3-l3-q16"}]}]}